+/**
+ * The agent-facing render of a call the user interrupted before the deciding
+ * `authorizerChain` link ruled (pi-nix patch). Says that nothing was refused:
+ * the user stopped the turn to give guidance, and the agent should follow it
+ * rather than treat the call as forbidden.
