+    `The user interrupted the turn before the '${linkName}' authorizer ruled on this ${identification(payload, budget, "call", askRuleClause(payload))}${boundaryClause(payload)}${provenanceClause(payload)}, so it did not run. Nothing was denied; follow the user's next message.`,
+    reason,
